"P4225414454" "Erm... yes. I mean, no. No, I don't have anything for you. Erm... we really don't care for villains around here. Maybe you should go someplace else. Please?"
// TaskForceInvite :
"P1018167860" "Oh, I'm so glad you're here, {HeroName}! I've just found out that some villains are trying to steal Hero 1's time capsule. Please take your friends and stop them. <color orange>You need to act fast to catch the criminals in the act.</color>"
// PlayerLevelTooLow :
"P616564484" "Erm... well, you see... this is a little awkward... Frankly, {HeroName}, I'm worried that this mission might be more than you can handle.<br><br><color orange>Return when you are Level 45 or higher.</color>"
