"P1396491506" "I cower before your magnificence! (PlayerLevelTooHigh)"
// NeedLargeTeam :
"P232120883" "Yes, yes, there's something you should attend to, {HeroName}, but it's not something you can handle alone. I think maybe that 4 of you could do it. Maybe you have some friends who will help?<br><br><color orange>You need at least 4 heroes on your team to accept this Taskforce.</color>"
